          "type": "richtext",
          "required": true,
          "value": "<p>I started out fixing flaky deploy scripts and never really stopped. Today I lead platform work for a 60-engineer org: the ingestion pipeline, the query layer, and the internal tooling that keeps both boring.</p><p>I care about <strong>measurable outcomes</strong>, written design docs, and leaving every codebase easier to change than I found it. Outside work I maintain a small open-source tracing library and mentor early-career engineers.</p>"
